    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "SQL expressions run on the Grafana server",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Grafana runs expressions (SQL, Reduce, Math) on the Grafana **server**: the ClickHouse query under an expression is executed by the plugin backend, not by the browser.\n\nExpressions work only when ClickHouse is reachable from the Grafana server. With the **Browser** access mode and a ClickHouse that only the browser can reach, regular panels show data, but a panel with an expression fails. See the row below."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Join of two table queries",
      "datasource": {
